<%#
# Key: skills/discovery/instructions
# Purpose: Available-skill discovery section.
# Used: Included in model-visible content when LittleGhost needs the available-skill discovery section.
# Locals:
# - skills: Available skill metadata rendered into the system prompt.
# Constraints:
# - Must render non-blank.
# - Keep skill names and metadata represented so the model can select a valid skill.
# - Keep the catalog in Markdown.
-%>
## Available skills

<% skills.each do |skill| -%>
- **Name:** <%= skill.fetch(:name) %>
  - **Description:** <%= skill.fetch(:description) %>
  - **Location:** <%= skill.fetch(:location) %>
<% end -%>
